    "description": "HG-2 (MP5K) (REPACK): Laffs Dynamics\n\nA handguard for the HK MP5K, MP5K PDW, and licensed copies/clones. (SMG and pistol variants.)\n\nHas 1 1/2 M-Lok slots on the 4-5, 6, and 7-8 o clock facets, as well as 1 M-Lok slot on the 3 and 9 o clock facets. \n\nVented towards the top of the handguard for better air cooling during rapid fire. \n\nTest fitted on an MKE AP5-M. (HK licensed and tooling built.)\n\n\nTwo variants are available:\n\n *Standard, Handstop\n *Non-Handstop\n\n\nUpdate: Non-Handstop design variant has been added to the data pack.\n\n\n\nFilament Recommended: Glass Filled Nylon, Carbon Fiber Nylon\n\nPrint Settings:\n\nFirst Layer Print Height: .20mm \nStandard Layer Height: .12mm - .16mm\nWall Thickness: .40 \nWall Perimeters: 8+\nInfill: 60%+\nSupport Material Percentage: 20%\n\nPrint the handguard on it's rear face. ",
